---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Player from '../components/Player.astro';
---
<Layout title="Time Share Radio | Turn Attention Into Momentum" description="Time Share Radio gives independent artists a focused platform to reach listeners, build momentum, and own their moment.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-noise"></div>
    <div class="eyebrow"><span></span> Independent sounds. Real attention.</div>
    <h1>YOUR MUSIC.<br /><em>YOUR MOMENT.</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-copy">A WordPress plugin that gives radio stations and artist platforms a connected artist directory, bio pages, and music storefront.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="https://www.paypal.com/ncp/payment/2DSWELQCG67ZG">Buy the plugin <b>↗</b></a><a class="button ghost" href="/artist/">Explore the demo</a></div>
    <Player />
    <div class="ticker"><span>ARTIST SPOTLIGHT</span><i>✦</i><span>CURATED DISCOVERY</span><i>✦</i><span>REAL LISTENERS</span><i>✦</i><span>YOUR TURN ON AIR</span></div>
  </section>

  <section class="statement" id="about">
    <div><span class="section-num">01 / THE PLUGIN</span><h2>ONE PLUGIN.<br />THE FULL STAGE.</h2></div>
    <div class="statement-copy"><p>Time Share Radio adds structured artist bios and a connected music shop to WordPress, giving every artist a profile and every release a path to purchase.</p><p>Install once. Create artists, publish music, and let the plugin build the experience.</p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="steps">
    <div class="section-heading"><span class="section-num">02 / HOW IT WORKS</span><h2>FROM UPLOAD<br /><em>TO ON AIR.</em></h2></div>
    <div class="step-grid">
      <article><span>01</span><div class="step-icon">↥</div><h3>Submit your track</h3><p>Send us the song you want listeners to hear, along with your artist details and artwork.</p></article>
      <article><span>02</span><div class="step-icon">◉</div><h3>Claim your time</h3><p>Choose your spotlight and give your music a dedicated moment in the broadcast.</p></article>
      <article><span>03</span><div class="step-icon">⌁</div><h3>Build momentum</h3><p>Share your feature, reach new ears, and turn discovery into your next true fan.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="manifesto">
    <p>THE AIRWAVES ARE OPEN.</p><h2>YOUR NEXT LISTENER<br />IS ALREADY <em>TUNING IN.</em></h2>
    <a class="button light" href="/artist/">Start your spotlight <b>↗</b></a>
  </section>
</Layout>
